      "author_handle": "Shaz_81",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 7 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "Hi all,\nNeed some recommendations! I have two teens and looking for something for them to do over the summer as I'll be working for most of it.\nDidn't realise they do american style camps in the uk - has anyone experienced these?",
