      "post_id": "91838",
      "author_handle": "Schriebsy",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 6 years 7 months ago",
      "body": "i tend to book mini minors - its a day camp in north London and I think this is there only location. Looks like they do offer residentials though - so worth a look on their website (called xuk camps).\nIf you prefer a day camp, what about barracudas or supercamps? Not sure if yours are too old though.",
