    {
      "post_id": "93778",
      "author_handle": "johnmichelle",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 7 months 3 weeks ago",
      "body": "Hi! American-style camps in the UK can be a great experience for teens—lots of fun activities, new friends, and a chance to try something different. I’ve heard positive things about them, and it can be a good way for your teens to stay active and engaged while you're working. Make sure to check reviews and ask about the program details to find one that suits their interests!",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-10782/#93778",
